    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95264" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σκυθ-ιστί</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[τῐ]</span>, Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in Scythian fashion</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σ. χειρόμακτρον
			ἐκκεκαρμένος</span>, with reference to the use of scalps as
			napkins (cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.64
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				473
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>in the Scythian tongue</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.27
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				59
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Parmeno
				1.2
			</span></i>.</div>
